  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f6bbc083438772d45a4be4890cec2bf6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  slideImages:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 86a6e8b4191fc1745b29376bf53777e6, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 95c2518cc21c6a144ac39dbc42bec053, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: f6a4568efcdb5674a8f336484986601c, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: bb8e07afc1e7e784ea1e781ebac6dc0a, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 40002b639bedc3f4f8ef0721991cb1c6, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: c3dc1c4e384a95147bdfb493d51e6682, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7505d19490e894f4e9d038bd01e0fc94, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: ed636b7b6062f224992e362b876ac4c3, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 05dbcd47743a3f4419f451ac03ed2020, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: e357545864846604badd96f02c17584e, type: 3}
  finalImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e3f7ab8620c2ef04b80249f34596b33b, type: 3}
  mainAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5b05f1daf25a078498098841a6dca5bc, type: 3}
  finalAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 53077e13417e7f8489eaeacc6a305ef7, type: 3}
  voiceoverAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 24fd35c8391e60441949172a4533f0b5, type: 3}
  canvas: {fileID: 1472908117}
  imageA: {fileID: 1007981927}
  imageB: {fileID: 679435483}
  blackOverlay: {fileID: 1271646742}
  finalImageDisplay: {fileID: 2059522148}
  mainAudioSource: {fileID: 398512626}
  finalAudioSource: {fileID: 258460365}
  voiceoverAudioSource: {fileID: 1571607614}
  skipHintText: {fileID: 761733907}
  subtitleText: {fileID: 1452314527}
  perSlideDuration: 14
  crossfadeDuration: 1.5
  audioFadeInDuration: 2
  audioFadeOutDuration: 2
  blackTransitionDuration: 0
  pauseBeforeFinalImage: 4
  finalImageFlyDuration: 0.1
  finalSceneHoldDuration: 13
  finalFadeOutDuration: 2
  finalImageStartScale: 0.05
  finalImageEndScale: 1
  finalImageStartYOffset: 800
  mainAudioMaxVolume: 0.1
  finalAudioMaxVolume: 0.25
  voiceoverMaxVolume: 1
  subtitleFadeDuration: 0.3
  subtitles:
  - startTime: 0.08
    text: In this world, the sun doesn't shine to give life. It shines so you can
      clearly see how badly things are about to go wrong.
  - startTime: 10.16
    text: The desert isn't a place. It's just what's left after everyone stopped
      caring.
  - startTime: 17.06
    text: And we are flying.
  - startTime: 19.3
    text: "The helicopter screams like it already regrets being part of this story.
      Inside it \u2014 a man who decided that stealing an armored war machine was
      a \"quick job.\""
  - startTime: 31.7
    text: Optimism. The most lethal substance in the wasteland.
  - startTime: 36.41
    text: They spot us immediately. Of course they do. Even the dust here has early
      warning systems.
  - startTime: 44.5
    text: The first helicopter goes down fast. Like it was just waiting for an excuse
      to retire.
  - startTime: 50.5
    text: "The second follows right after \u2014 dramatically, like a failed career
      trajectory."
  - startTime: 56.78
    text: No one mourns. Emotional capacity is limited. Ammunition is not.
  - startTime: 62.2
    text: I grab the machine gun. It's warm. Like a handshake from someone who will
      absolutely try to kill you later.
  - startTime: 70.52
    text: Down below, raiders run around like no one told them this isn't a training
      simulation.
  - startTime: 77.5
    text: We don't explain.
  - startTime: 78.3
    text: We answer in bursts of fire.
  - startTime: 80.28
    text: One by one, they stop being problems and become scenery.
  - startTime: 84.78
    text: "And then it hits me \u2014 the first rule of this desert: if it moves,
      it's either an enemy\u2026 or a bad idea. Either way, it gets the same solution."
  - startTime: 97
    text: Now it's just us.
  - startTime: 98.5
    text: One helicopter. One pilot. And a plan that wouldn't survive basic reasoning.
  - startTime: 105.5
    text: "Ahead \u2014 the base."
  - startTime: 106.83
    text: It looks like a scrapyard someone decided to defend out of pure spite.
  - startTime: 110.5
    text: '"Maybe we should fall back?" logic asks.'
  - startTime: 113.5
    text: But logic already fell out somewhere between the second explosion and the
      first bullet.
  - startTime: 120.56
    text: So we keep flying.
  - startTime: 122.2
    text: Because in this world, survival doesn't belong to the strongest.
  - startTime: 127.18
    text: Or the smartest.
  - startTime: 129.64
    text: "It belongs to whoever still has ammo\u2026 and no better options left."
  nextSceneName: IntroScene
